WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.015
A tour of the curated example. These are real sources, not a live Markov research run.

00:00:05.015 --> 00:00:09.734
Start with one link: NASA’s 2023 water-recovery milestone.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:16.297
Follow the same question into a different setting: a recycled-water beer project.

00:00:16.297 --> 00:00:22.437
Or into another industry: a chip factory’s future water-recycling plans.

00:00:22.437 --> 00:00:29.015
The connection becomes a different script idea: investigate trust, not just the filter.

00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:36.672
Open a three-part outline. Reporting questions and factual limits stay visible.

00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:42.234
Copy the idea with its outline, boundaries and original source links.

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:46.234
Or download it as Markdown. No account is needed to explore this example.
